AppImage type2-runtime
Source commit: 8f39b89e2ac31e1640b3d3f7e9a5108e6ce805fa
https://github.com/AppImage/type2-runtime

The runtime includes statically linked third-party code. Its upstream build
scripts select libfuse 3.15.0 and squashfuse 0.5.2 and obtain other dependencies
from Alpine Linux. The runtime Makefile also links mimalloc, although the
upstream executable's help omits it from the displayed library list.

The accompanying files preserve the runtime MIT license, libfuse LGPL-2.1
license, and notices for squashfuse, musl, zstd, zlib and mimalloc. The pinned
source archive and dependency patch/build scripts are in the corresponding
sources artifact. Permissive-library notice reference versions in
runtime-sources.json do not assert bit-identical upstream build provenance.
